        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Alinta Energy, Chow Tai Fook Enterprises\n- Places: Playford B Power Station, Curlew Island, Port Augusta, Point Lowly\n\nFacts:\n- Playford B Power Station was mothballed in 2012.\n- In October 2015, Alinta Energy announced the permanent closure of Playford B Power Station.\n- Alinta Energy is an Australian private company in electricity generation and electricity and gas retailing.\n- Chow Tai Fook Enterprises, based in Hong Kong, owns Alinta Energy.\n- Curlew Island in South Australia lies between Port Augusta and Point Lowly.\n- Curlew Island is adjacent to Playford B Power Station.",
